# ScriptPlayerActor spa3: hive03_dark (3bfa3eff) e001b013d with the grapple beam; after the grapple
# models are loaded (f700) re-activate the actor several times so SetupEnvFx (forced to rain by
# tools/cov/specs/spa3_force.py) builds the projected shadow while mGrappleModelData is live
# (PreRender HasGrappleModelData arms).
@f260 layer 2
@f300 god 1; give grappleBeam 1
@f340 send e001b013d Activate
@f700 obj e001b013d
@f720 send e001b013d Increment
@f760 send e001b013d Deactivate
@f800 send e001b013d Activate
@f900 send e001b013d Deactivate
@f940 send e001b013d Activate
@f1000 send e001b013d Deactivate
@f1040 send e001b013d Activate
@f1100 take grappleBeam
@f1200 send e001b013d Deactivate
@f1300 send e001b013d Delete
